WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:23.693
Kip walked to the beach.

2
00:00:23.694 --> 00:00:31.614
It was cold and windy.

3
00:00:31.615 --> 00:00:37.403
"I'll find a new friend here," he said.

4
00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:42.526
Kip saw two seagulls.

5
00:00:42.527 --> 00:00:54.228
"They're friends with each other," said Kip.

6
00:00:54.229 --> 00:01:05.812
"They don't want to be friends with me."

7
00:01:05.813 --> 00:01:26.169
Kip saw two crabs.

8
00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:28.497
They pinched Kip's toe.

9
00:01:28.498 --> 00:01:34.107
"Ouch!" cried Kip.

10
00:01:34.108 --> 00:01:46.117
"I don't want to be friends with them!"

11
00:01:46.118 --> 00:01:49.957
Kip sat down.

12
00:01:49.958 --> 00:02:00.596
"I miss Bird," he said.

13
00:02:00.597 --> 00:02:06.161
"I wish we were still friends."

14
00:02:06.162 --> 00:02:09.458
Just then Bird landed next to Kip.

15
00:02:09.459 --> 00:02:17.102
"We're still friends," she said.

16
00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:21.799
"But you were keeping secrets," said Kip.

17
00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:25.245
"Friends shouldn't do that."

18
00:02:25.246 --> 00:02:28.379
"I'm sorry," said Bird.

19
00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:31.881
"I just didn't want you to see this."

20
00:02:31.882 --> 00:02:36.438
Bird held up a green and yellow scarf.

21
00:02:36.439 --> 00:02:46.502
"I was making it for you," said Bird.

22
00:02:46.503 --> 00:02:54.078
Kip put on the scarf.

23
00:02:54.079 --> 00:03:03.597
"Thanks for the scarf, Bird," said Kip.

24
00:03:03.598 --> 00:03:14.060
"And thanks for being my friend."
